{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05387","headline":"奉和圣制左丞相说右丞相璟太子少傅乾曜同日上官命宴都堂赐诗 · 宇文融","name":"奉和圣制左丞相说右丞相璟太子少傅乾曜同日上官命宴都堂赐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"申甫生周日，宣慈举舜年。\n何如偶昌运，比德迈前贤。\n宠获元良密，荣瞻端揆迁。\n职优三事老，位在百僚先。\n北极回宸渥，南宫饰御筵。\n飞文瑶札降，赐酒玉杯传。\n谬列台衡重，俱承雨露偏。\n誓将同竭力，相与效尘涓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宇文融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}